    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sequencing a story",
     "texto": [
      "To order events we use **najpierw** («first»), **potem/później** («then/later») and **na końcu** («at the end»).",
      "The past form changes with the person and gender: **zrobiłem** (said by a man), **zrobiłam** (said by a woman), **zrobiliśmy** (masculine or mixed group)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
